The structure templates in this folder are copied from data/betterdungeons/structure/ in that jar: the
start room, rooms and stairs of its zombie dungeon and the bridges and stairs of its skeleton dungeon.
Each room's YAML sidecar names its source file.

Changed by Realmforge (2026-10-14), with `rf rooms import` and the rules in
art/rooms/yungs_better_dungeons/rules.yaml of the Realmforge repository:
- minecraft:chain renamed to minecraft:iron_chain, its name since Minecraft 1.21.9;
- jigsaws inside a room (props, cubbies, loot piles) replaced by the block they leave behind, and the
  connectors renamed realmforge:door (sides) and realmforge:shaft (up, down);
- the containers' betterdungeons loot tables removed (vanilla ones stay);
- templates written back in a normalized form (blocks sorted, stored deflate).
